name babelbib
category Package
revision 57349
shortdesc Multilingual bibliographies
relocated 1
longdesc This package enables the user to generate multilingual
longdesc bibliographies in cooperation with babel. Two approaches are
longdesc possible: Each citation may be written in another language, or
longdesc the whole bibliography can be typeset in a language chosen by
longdesc the user. In addition, the package supports commands to change
longdesc the typography of the bibliographies.
